      "updated_at": "2026-03-27T02:15:27Z",
      "body": "Hi @atsyplikhin \nIIRC, it's not recommended to run another Zenoh API inside the callback. Zenoh is async design, which means that it has limited rx thread to receive packets. Doing something inside the callback will block the rx thread, and I believe this is why you can't receive any reply in the callback intermittently. I would suggest moving the `session.get()` out of the callback to avoid the issue.",
